=== L2 grammar:  S -> aSb | ab ===
  L2: 'ab'         derivable in 1 step(s)
           S
        => ab
  L2: 'aabb'       derivable in 2 step(s)
           S
        => aSb
        => aabb
  L2: 'aaabbb'     derivable in 3 step(s)
           S
        => aSb
        => aaSbb
        => aaabbb

=== The same grammar, on strings that are NOT in L2 ===
  L2: 'aab'        NOT derivable
  L2: 'abb'        NOT derivable
  L2: 'ba'         NOT derivable
  L2: 'aaabbbb'    NOT derivable

=== L1 grammar:  S -> aS | a  (regular) ===
  L1: 'a'          derivable in 1 step(s)
           S
        => a
  L1: 'aaa'        derivable in 3 step(s)
           S
